{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13104010","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13104010","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1310401001:1":{"text":"仮面舞踏会は初めてなのですが、変な格好をしたり、顔に大げさなペイントを描いたりするんですか？","source_cn":"化装舞会是什么样的？满满还从来没有参加过……嗯，是不是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9D17663C4DB3076","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310401002:1":{"text":"ははっ、変な格好をする必要はない。舞踏会用の服で十分だ。もしくは、仮面をつけてもいい。","source_cn":"哈哈，不用穿“奇怪的衣服”，只要换套适合舞会的就可以了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DACB7A3859BA812","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310401003:1":{"text":"そっか、仮面舞踏会ですもんね。","source_cn":"咦，戴着面具跳舞？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF0CE9A032061510","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310401004:1":{"text":"第一次神魔大戦の勝利後、ここの人々は悪を町の端まで追い払う意味を込めて、カタストロフの格好でパレードを行うようになった。","source_cn":"在第一次神魔战争胜利以后，这里的人会在庆典中打扮成恶魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A8FA1D909AC4392","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310401005:1":{"text":"それが後に舞踏会へと変わっていったのだ。舞踏会ともなれば、誰だって醜いカタストロフの仮装よりも、美しく着飾って踊りたいものだろう？","source_cn":"这种巡游后来逐渐演变为现在的舞会。而舞会嘛……你们应该...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1D07AA8282A4623","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310401006:1":{"text":"だから今は各々自慢の服を着て参加している。伝統を重んじる者はカタストロフの仮面をつけて、かつての戦いに敬意を表するのだ。","source_cn":"所以现在，参加舞会的人会穿上自己最好的衣服，那些注重仪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC1252F3E90AFCEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310401007:1":{"text":"ということは、新しい服と仮面が必要ですね！","source_cn":"这么说，我们也应该准备新的服装和面具？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA60C1371F943168","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1310401008:1":{"text":"それなら、町にいる<style=\"highlight\">衣装商人</style>を訪ねるといい。きっと気に入る服が見つかるはずだ。","source_cn":"如果你们需要的话，雪松镇上就有<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67B429F54FF0885F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1310401009:1":{"text":"ああ、それと。今年の会場は<style=\"highlight\">広場の南東にある、町で一番高い丘</style>に設けられている。","source_cn":"对了，请别忘记，今年的舞会会场设在<style=hig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x605DEE571A883FA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310401010:1":{"text":"了解です！ありがとうございます！","source_cn":"放心，我们不会走错的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DB145DA3A27EE98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_fem